{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Cursed Blood ruptures Taldaram's Torment onto nearby enemies (#3131)",
  "contract": [
    "Cursed Blood 707435 has a single effect in Spell.dbc: SPELL_EFFECT_APPLY_AURA with aura 354, BasePoints 99",
    "+ DieSides 1 = 100 (the whole hit, \"an additional time\"), TriggerSpell Cursed Blood 707708 and the",
    "record's own ProcChance 20, which is the $h the description renders. 707708 is SPELL_EFFECT_SCHOOL_DAMAGE",
    "with BasePoints 0, TargetA 6 plus TargetB 16 over radius index 8 (5 yards), i.e. the target and everything",
    "hostile around it. Aura 354 has no AuraEffectHandler entry, no AuraEffect::HandleProc case and is not an",
    "isTriggerAura, and 707435's own ProcFlags are 0, so SpellMgr generated no SpellProcEntry and the talent",
    "did nothing. Every Taldaram's Torment rank (800772, 802568-802573, 802580 - the only family-26 records",
    "with SpellFamilyFlags (0, 0, 2097152)) is a bleed: effect 0 is aura 3 SPELL_AURA_PERIODIC_DAMAGE at a 3000",
    "ms amplitude over duration index 8 (15000 ms), so five ticks per application, and none of the eight ranks",
    "has a direct damage effect. \"Damage dealt by Taldaram's Torment\" is therefore periodic damage and the proc",
    "belongs on PROC_FLAG_DONE_PERIODIC. 802580 is the rank a level-80 character owns. The harness provides no",
    "statistical test, so the assertion is \"at least once in N trials\": four victims times five ticks times",
    "four applications provide at least 80 observed native 20% proc opportunities, and 0.8^80 is 1.8e-8. Each",
    "application is funded with health, because the spell uses POWER_HEALTH; restoring Rage never funded the",
    "later casts in the old fixture. The bystander is never targeted and the caster deals it no other damage,",
    "so any drop in its health is the rupture splashing off a neighbour; all five creatures converge into melee",
    "contact with the caster, which keeps them inside 707708's five-yard radius."
  ],
